delegation-*

# Agent scratch. Nothing under `.claude/` is tracked — the shipped plugin manifest is
# in `.claude-plugin/`. Named rather than ignoring the whole directory so that adding
# something shareable there later is a deliberate act, not a silent one.
#
# These lived in .git/info/exclude, which is per-clone: it protected exactly one
# machine, and a detached worktree would have shown up as untracked for everyone else.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/tasks/
